@description TotalReaper
@author Frank Acklin
@version 0.1.9
@changelog
  Fix 2-Way Control snapping REAPER faders to -inf when Routing Mirror is toggled on. /sendall was firing before the REAPER→TotalMix push completed, so the empty TotalMix state came back and 2-Way wrote it into REAPER. Push now happens first; a brief priming window after push absorbs /sendall echoes without disturbing track state.
